hangelog">v<!-- -->3.4.0</a></div></aside><main class="documentation-sidebar__content"><h2 class="bold" id="sections"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="sections#sections">Sections</a></h2>
<p><strong>Functionally related elements</strong> are usually placed <strong>in sections</strong> which create
uniform space across a whole webpage.</p>
<p><strong>A section</strong> occupies full width of the screen and <strong>sets background color</strong> to it. It
is possible to set <strong><a href="../../components/section#colors" class="underline">black, white or light gray(gray-300)</a></strong> as a background.</p>
<p>Feel free to use <strong>white and black</strong> (<a href="https://design.orange.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/Digital-Colour-Palettes-Guideline-v2.pdf" target="_blank">main Orange colors</a>), <strong>gray should
be used just when none of them is suitable.</strong></p>
<p><strong>Spacing within a Section is usually created by vertical paddings of size
